I didn't think you'd wanna be late.


00:02:36.436 --> 00:02:39.371
Oh, look at you thinking. Cute.


00:02:39.539 --> 00:02:41.598
But I always have time for my portrait.


00:02:41.775 --> 00:02:43.299
Look alive. Paint.


00:02:43.743 --> 00:02:45.574
