00:03:03.196 --> 00:03:05.630
Lucky you never wait for me then.


00:03:19.112 --> 00:03:20.545
Victor, no.


00:03:27.220 --> 00:03:29.154
Uh, don't you want a glass?


00:03:29.322 --> 00:03:35.318
Hmm. Earthy. A tad fishy.
Lovely gravel finish.


00:03:35.795 --> 00:03:38.320
