as a theme for the dance?


00:04:18.104 --> 00:04:21.562
That's totally un-American.
I don't care if it was my idea.


00:04:23.243 --> 00:04:25.507
Hello.
Oh. Oh.


00:04:25.679 --> 00:04:28.375
