- Ah, yes. Guy Morgan, a pleasure.


00:04:31.818 --> 00:04:33.308
You look like a man who knows things.


00:04:33.486 --> 00:04:36.046
Aha, even some things I shouldn't know.


00:04:36.222 --> 00:04:38.019
