00:08:04.797 --> 00:08:08.426
Oh, do you want this?


00:08:13.239 --> 00:08:16.504
She shoots, she scores.
Unlike you, soccer boy.


00:08:18.845 --> 00:08:22.576
Oh, so spill it. Is Luke Morgan
