00:09:49.869 --> 00:09:51.029
Uh, no. Thanks.


00:09:51.204 --> 00:09:54.605
Uh, but what do you know
about Bev Van Ravensway?


00:09:54.774 --> 00:09:56.435
- Supposed to see her tonight.
- Bev?


00:09:56.609 --> 00:09:57.633
