- Mickey O'Malley.


00:10:05.084 --> 00:10:06.711
A rarity in the Irish community.


00:10:07.287 --> 00:10:09.380
Om.


00:10:10.189 --> 00:10:12.817
RAVl: Om.
- Om.


00:10:12.992 --> 00:10:15.085
- Om.
- Om!


00:10:15.261 --> 00:10:17.786
This is not a contest, Ms. Gail.


00:10:18.164 --> 00:10:19.791
Just concentrate on your breathing.


00:10:21.301 --> 00:10:22.461
My butt is numb.


00:10:22.802 --> 00:10:25.999
If your butt is suffering,
then you are suffering.


00:10:26.172 --> 00:10:29.630
In fact, your entire life is suffering. Why?


00:10:29.809 --> 00:10:32.903
Because you crave
that which is meaningless.


00:10:33.079 --> 00:10:35.070
