00:10:42.155 --> 00:10:45.716
Just release it. Release it, yeah.
Release that butt.


00:10:46.592 --> 00:10:49.652
<i>Release that butt
Oh, yeah, release that butt</i>


00:10:49.829 --> 00:10:52.423
<i>Oh, yeah, release that butt</i>


