I'm on the phone.</i>


00:12:03.269 --> 00:12:04.861
<i>- I'm cleansing.
Heh, heh.</i>


00:12:05.071 --> 00:12:07.301
Mac and cheese.


00:12:08.207 --> 00:12:11.335
<i>I don't need your spiritual counseling.</i>


00:12:11.878 --> 00:12:13.436
