I've transcended to a whole new level.


00:13:32.492 --> 00:13:33.516
Yeah, I doubt it.


00:13:33.693 --> 00:13:36.253
When my first single drops,
I'll buy you that mansion...


00:13:36.429 --> 00:13:38.363
