00:16:01.273 --> 00:16:05.369
<i>I've got a one-way ticket
And I just got here</i>


00:16:05.544 --> 00:16:06.875
<i>I'm gonna run...</i>


00:16:07.046 --> 00:16:09.810
- Ha-ha-ha.
- Victor, what are you doing?


00:16:10.249 --> 00:16:11.546
Victor!


00:16:11.717 --> 00:16:14.948
Victor, where did you put my clothes?


00:16:15.121 --> 00:16:17.282
- Surprise!
- What? No.


00:16:20.793 --> 00:16:22.420
I'm gonna kill you. Victor!


00:16:32.338 --> 00:16:33.498
Oh, hi, Katie.


00:16:33.673 --> 00:16:35.072
You are evil. Let me in.


00:16:35.241 --> 00:16:38.677
I control every lock on this property.


00:16:38.844 --> 00:16:40.505
Crap.


00:16:43.916 --> 00:16:45.611
This is insane.


00:16:45.785 --> 00:16:49.846
Yeah, try the shed, it's unlocked, idiot.


00:16:59.632 --> 00:17:01.725
You gotta be kidding me.


00:17:03.469 --> 00:17:05.096
Crap.


00:17:08.407 --> 00:17:12.002
How did such an untalented daughter
spring from my loins?


00:17:12.178 --> 00:17:15.978
Focus, Ms. Gail. We are making
an offering to your personal deity.


00:17:16.148 --> 00:17:18.275
Tell him to give me fame and fortune.


00:17:18.451 --> 00:17:20.146
Not exactly how it works.


00:17:20.319 --> 00:17:22.879
<i>Now, breathe through your Mula Bandha.</i>


00:17:23.055 --> 00:17:26.115
Oh, honey, if I could do that,
I'd get a million hits on YouTube.


00:17:26.292 --> 00:17:28.522
How much longer is this gonna take?
Ugh.


00:17:28.694 --> 00:17:30.821
The prayer or the fame and fortune?


00:17:33.165 --> 00:17:34.632
Ha, ha. See you later.


00:17:40.806 --> 00:17:42.671
Victor.


00:17:46.512 --> 00:17:47.945
Katie?


00:17:49.148 --> 00:17:51.378
- Luke.
- Katie.


00:17:51.584 --> 00:17:54.849
- Are you wearing a doormat?
- Yes.


00:17:55.020 --> 00:17:57.784
- Welcome.
- Why, thank you.


00:17:58.824 --> 00:18:00.655
The truth. Um...


00:18:01.961 --> 00:18:05.294
My stepbrother locked me
outside of the house.


00:18:05.464 --> 00:18:06.795
Naked.


00:18:07.833 --> 00:18:10.131
Oh, sorry. You should...
You should take my jacket.


00:18:10.302 --> 00:18:11.826
Oh.
- Oh, no, no.


00:18:14.273 --> 00:18:15.365
There.


00:18:15.541 --> 00:18:18.738
- Thanks. Now the pants.
- Hmm?


00:18:23.349 --> 00:18:24.976
I'm kidding.


00:18:25.518 --> 00:18:27.349
- You got me.
- Ha, ha.


00:18:27.686 --> 00:18:28.710
No, no.


00:18:28.888 --> 00:18:32.289
One more parent-teacher conference,
I swear I'm gonna lose it.


00:18:32.458 --> 00:18:34.653
Look at me. I'm an educator.


00:18:35.261 --> 00:18:39.925
I have no real skills. And I will die
before I go back to my daddy's farm.


00:18:40.432 --> 00:18:44.232
You tell my personal deity
to help me achieve Guy Morgan. Do it.


00:18:44.403 --> 00:18:46.997
I'll put another banana on the altar.


00:18:50.876 --> 00:18:52.537
What is that?


00:18:53.112 --> 00:18:55.376
Do you hear angels singing?


00:18:55.548 --> 00:18:57.516
Perhaps the gods
have answered your prayer.


00:18:58.717 --> 00:19:00.446
Hey. What...?


00:19:13.299 --> 00:19:15.790
<i>- This is Gail Van Ravensway.
Hello.</i>


00:19:15.968 --> 00:19:17.595
Guy Morgan here. How are you?


00:19:17.770 --> 00:19:19.897
Oh, well, hello, Guy.


00:19:20.072 --> 00:19:22.336
What a surprise
to see you calling this number.


00:19:22.508 --> 00:19:23.532
Do you hear this?


00:19:23.709 --> 00:19:25.370
<i>I can justify</i>


00:19:25.544 --> 00:19:27.239
That's the demo your girl, Katie...


00:19:27.413 --> 00:19:29.745
<i>... slipped into my briefcase.</i>


00:19:29.915 --> 00:19:32.110
And it sounds like money, dear.


00:19:32.284 --> 00:19:34.149
She gave you a CD?


00:19:34.320 --> 00:19:37.687
Oh, well. Well, ain't that the berries.


00:19:38.924 --> 00:19:42.792
Ravi, what frigging god did you pray to?


00:19:44.029 --> 00:19:48.125
Guy, yeah, it seems someone's
not being entirely honest here.


00:19:50.102 --> 00:19:52.297
Katie, somebody get that door!


00:19:53.439 --> 00:19:54.997
So...


00:19:55.875 --> 00:19:58.002
...that meeting today...


00:19:58.177 --> 00:20:00.975
...it was obvious
that your dad doesn't get you.


00:20:01.313 --> 00:20:03.372
He's an idiot for not liking your music.


00:20:03.549 --> 00:20:05.983
Well, it's... It's complicated.


00:20:06.252 --> 00:20:07.446
I'm gonna just, uh...


00:20:08.921 --> 00:20:10.821
Is it as complicated as me...


00:20:10.990 --> 00:20:14.118
...getting stuck outside
in only a welcome mat?


00:20:14.393 --> 00:20:18.124
That's not complicated.
That is a gift from God.


00:20:23.035 --> 00:20:25.833
Luke. Katie. What are you doing?


00:20:26.005 --> 00:20:29.065
Well, it seems your brother
is Satan's very own personal Mini-Me.


00:20:29.241 --> 00:20:31.505
Oh, I know, tell me about it. Come on in.


00:20:35.481 --> 00:20:37.142
Oh, my God, did you work out today?


00:20:38.817 --> 00:20:40.114
- Sit down.
- Ooh, look at this.


00:20:40.286 --> 00:20:43.380
- Ha, ha. Some lemonade.
- Why, thank you.


00:20:43.555 --> 00:20:46.023
You know, my stepsister,
she has body issues...


00:20:46.191 --> 00:20:48.352
...so I don't like
to discourage her nudity.


00:20:48.527 --> 00:20:49.721
That's interesting.


00:20:49.895 --> 00:20:52.659
- She's absolutely lovely...
- Would you like an appetizer?


00:20:52.831 --> 00:20:54.059
<i>Oh, fromage.</i>


00:20:54.233 --> 00:20:55.860
I only have cheese.


00:20:59.038 --> 00:21:01.006
I just got off the phone
with Guy Morgan.


00:21:01.173 --> 00:21:03.073
Your phone.


00:21:06.111 --> 00:21:08.978
He just loved that little demo
you left him.


00:21:09.148 --> 00:21:10.706
I have underestimated you.


00:21:11.283 --> 00:21:13.114
It'd make me proud
if I cared about you.


00:21:13.285 --> 00:21:16.379
- I didn't lie about anything.
- Oh, but, chicken, you did.


00:21:16.555 --> 00:21:19.183
At least that's what Guy thinks,
now that I've clarified.


00:21:19.358 --> 00:21:23.556
I told him it was Bev's demo
and that you stole it from her.


00:21:23.729 --> 00:21:26.994
- But you can't do that. That's my song.
- It's Bev's song.


00:21:27.166 --> 00:21:30.602
And Guy can't wait to see her perform it
at the Showcase.


00:21:30.769 --> 00:21:33.897
If you try to contact him, I'll deny
everything and lock you in the basement.


00:21:34.073 --> 00:21:39.204
- She can't sing to save her life.
- No, but you can, can't you?


00:21:40.479 --> 00:21:42.640
Now, let's hear this amazing voice.


00:21:48.053 --> 00:21:52.683
<i>Like a malignant tumor
She's got no sense of humor</i>


00:21:52.858 --> 00:21:56.954
<i>Just like a swollen blister
It's best to just resist her</i>


00:21:57.129 --> 00:22:00.895
<i>She's not exactly a witch
She's just a terrible bi...</i>


00:22:01.367 --> 00:22:03.028
Well, your lyrics stink.


00:22:03.202 --> 00:22:05.363
But Guy's right, you've got chops.


00:22:08.607 --> 00:22:11.303
Do you know what other instruments
I'm good at?


00:22:11.877 --> 00:22:15.335
I have a feeling I could get in trouble
with a question like that.


00:22:15.781 --> 00:22:17.749
I like trouble.


00:22:19.284 --> 00:22:20.410
Hey, kids.


00:22:21.720 --> 00:22:25.156
- Good evening, Miss Van Ravensway.
- Sorry, I need you to go. Now.


00:22:25.324 --> 00:22:28.088
Family emergency. I need Bev
to help me pass a kidney stone.


00:22:28.260 --> 00:22:32.094
- So she had a lovely evening. Ta-ta.
- Are you trying to ruin my life?


00:22:32.398 --> 00:22:37.631
I have figured out a way for you
to wow Guy Morgan in the Showcase.


00:22:37.836 --> 00:22:40.304
- So you do think I've improved?
- Oh, no, honey.


00:22:40.572 --> 00:22:43.132
But my month of spiritual devotion
has taught me...


00:22:43.308 --> 00:22:45.276
...that God works in annoying ways.


00:22:45.444 --> 00:22:48.504
How am I to wow Guy Morgan
if I supposedly can't sing?


00:22:48.680 --> 00:22:51.740
You can't, but Katie can.


00:22:51.917 --> 00:22:54.613
- What?
- I know. Like I said, annoying.


00:22:54.787 --> 00:22:58.086
We'll record her voice
and you will lip synch.


00:22:58.257 --> 00:23:00.088
What if I don't want to?


00:23:01.193 --> 00:23:04.924
Don't you get snarky with me,
you ungrateful toad.


00:23:05.097 --> 00:23:07.156
- I saved your life.
- You didn't do anything.


00:23:07.332 --> 00:23:09.596
- My dad married you.
- Yeah, and then he died.


00:23:09.768 --> 00:23:13.329
I tried to put you in foster care,
but they was all fulled up on ugly.


00:23:13.505 --> 00:23:14.995
- Funny.
- I thought it was...


00:23:15.174 --> 00:23:16.641
...because you don't wanna look bad.


00:23:18.243 --> 00:23:20.370
Katie, if you don't sing...


00:23:20.546 --> 00:23:23.674
...I'm gonna find a way for that savings
your dad left to disappear.


00:23:24.083 --> 00:23:28.281
That means, you forget college,
moving out, you're stuck here with me.


00:23:28.454 --> 00:23:32.288
But, pumpkin, we're gonna have
so much fun growing old together.


00:23:32.458 --> 00:23:35.359
Why don't you just have her perform
if you like her so much?


00:23:35.527 --> 00:23:37.791
Because, honey, look at you.


00:23:37.963 --> 00:23:40.090
You are a star.


00:23:40.265 --> 00:23:44.463
That is what Guy Morgan needs.
You, the star.


00:23:44.636 --> 00:23:46.194
I'm a star.


00:23:46.371 --> 00:23:50.535
- A bright, gassy star.
- Yes, you are.


00:23:50.709 --> 00:23:53.109
And Guy Morgan is gonna
give you a swimming pool...


00:23:53.278 --> 00:23:55.246
...shaped just like Colin Farrell.


00:23:55.414 --> 00:23:56.972
Every part of him.


00:23:57.149 --> 00:24:00.676
Or, Bev, you could just see every part
of Colin Farrell on the Internet.


00:24:00.853 --> 00:24:03.617
And just leave me out of this.


00:24:04.890 --> 00:24:07.450
- Okay, so how do we do this?
- First rule of Lie Club...


00:24:07.626 --> 00:24:09.526
...is don't talk about Lie Club.


00:24:10.129 --> 00:24:12.029
Which includes you, Katie.


00:24:12.197 --> 00:24:14.893
As far as everyone knows,
you can't sing.


00:24:15.067 --> 00:24:17.126
And no more talking to Luke or Guy.


00:24:17.302 --> 00:24:18.667
Are we clear?


00:24:19.104 --> 00:24:20.298
Crystal.


00:24:22.241 --> 00:24:25.233
Yeah, Dad, we're about to meet
some fresh talent right now.


00:24:25.410 --> 00:24:29.403
Remember when you signed Jay-Z?
No, you passed on him, my bad.


00:24:29.581 --> 00:24:32.049
Um, this is like that,
except it's gonna be brilliant.


00:24:32.217 --> 00:24:33.548
Yeah. Okay.


00:24:33.719 --> 00:24:35.846
- Yeah, okay. Bye.
- Dude, what'd he say?


00:24:36.021 --> 00:24:37.545
These guys you told me about are good?


00:24:37.723 --> 00:24:41.090
Yes. The Oral Majority has potential.
They'll be here any second.


00:24:41.260 --> 00:24:43.956
Talking about potential,
how was your little date with Bev?


00:24:44.129 --> 00:24:46.393
- Her mom kicked me out.
- I told you. Bev is drama.


00:24:46.565 --> 00:24:48.123
Technically, it was Gail's drama.


00:24:48.300 --> 00:24:50.427
But Bev's interesting, man. She's...


00:24:50.602 --> 00:24:52.069
I'm worried she's bonkers.


00:24:52.237 --> 00:24:55.070
See, my last girlfriend, she was hot,
but absolutely mental.


00:24:55.240 --> 00:24:57.902
I need a girl who's not gonna be
shipped to the loony bin.


00:24:58.076 --> 00:24:59.839
Hang on, I'm gonna hit the facilities.


00:25:00.012 --> 00:25:01.707
Facilities. That's a new one.


00:25:02.147 --> 00:25:04.843
- Hey, man. Sorry we're late.
- Hey, what's good, y'all?


00:25:05.017 --> 00:25:07.747
Nobody talks to my boy
until he comes from the facilities.


00:25:07.920 --> 00:25:09.114
We're here to impress.


00:25:09.288 --> 00:25:11.552
- Clear, right?
- Got it.


00:25:15.394 --> 00:25:17.862
<i>When you're fighting just to keep it sane</i>


00:25:18.030 --> 00:25:20.294
<i>Throw your will
At the eye of the hurricane</i>


00:25:20.465 --> 00:25:22.660
<i>- Sing it out
- Eh-oh, eh-oh, eh-oh</i>


00:25:22.834 --> 00:25:26.201
<i>- Help me sing it out
- Eh-oh, eh-oh, eh-oh</i>


00:25:26.371 --> 00:25:28.896
<i>If you wanna find out who you are
Stop running</i>


00:25:29.074 --> 00:25:32.339
<i>In the end you'll figure out
It's all about nothing</i>


00:25:32.511 --> 00:25:37.813
<i>All night, it's gonna be all right
Hey, hey, hey, hey</i>


00:25:37.983 --> 00:25:44.718
<i>All right
Turn your dreams into your life</i>


00:25:45.924 --> 00:25:47.414
That's good.


00:25:54.466 --> 00:25:57.765
I'm clean. No one followed me.
And I got your intel.


00:25:58.604 --> 00:26:00.936
Oh, Katie, baby, your life sucks.


00:26:01.106 --> 00:26:03.006
Trust me, it gets worse.


00:26:04.042 --> 00:26:07.637
Okay, dude, those guys, they
just went Oral Majority on me in there...


00:26:07.813 --> 00:26:10.008
- I was trying to hold them back...
- You're right.


00:26:10.182 --> 00:26:12.116
They have potential and they're great.


00:26:12.284 --> 00:26:17.517
But first, my talent-finding friend,
promise me no more auditions in the bogs.


00:26:17.689 --> 00:26:19.884
- The what?
- The loo.


00:26:20.425 --> 00:26:22.188
- Bathroom. Toilet.
- Got it.


00:26:22.361 --> 00:26:24.955
All right. Okay, come on.
I wanna show you something.


00:26:25.564 --> 00:26:28.863
So now I have to rehearse in secret.


00:26:29.034 --> 00:26:30.501
Why not not rehearse?


00:26:30.669 --> 00:26:32.694
Make Bev sound bad. What do you care?


00:26:32.871 --> 00:26:35.863
No song, no savings account. No life.


00:26:38.043 --> 00:26:40.477
People. Coming. Now.


00:26:44.016 --> 00:26:45.847
Okay.


00:26:46.418 --> 00:26:48.784
Dude, what are we doing?
The suspense is killing me.


00:26:49.121 --> 00:26:50.884
Can you grab the mike?


00:26:51.056 --> 00:26:53.047
Not about to serenade
a brother, are you?


00:26:53.225 --> 00:26:55.056
Dude, with bromance, comes a fine line.


00:26:55.227 --> 00:26:57.525
That I shall not cross.


00:26:57.996 --> 00:27:00.294
So sing something.


00:27:01.967 --> 00:27:03.434
Okay.


00:27:07.572 --> 00:27:10.370
<i>I'm lost in a world
That rattles my brain</i>


00:27:10.542 --> 00:27:13.033
<i>I'm cleaning up my life
From the mess you made</i>


00:27:13.211 --> 00:27:14.610
<i>Oh, oh</i>


00:27:15.080 --> 00:27:17.071
<i>Whoa, oh, oh, oh</i>


00:27:18.884 --> 00:27:21.352
<i>My soul's in debt, but my bills are paid</i>


00:27:21.520 --> 00:27:24.045
<i>I'd give anything just to make an escape</i>


00:27:24.222 --> 00:27:25.814
<i>Oh, oh</i>


00:27:26.325 --> 00:27:27.952
<i>Whoa, oh, oh, oh</i>


00:27:28.960 --> 00:27:31.895
<i>So you can keep
Knocking, knocking, knocking</i>


00:27:32.064 --> 00:27:34.396
<i>Baby, you're rockin'
But there ain't no way I'm ever letting you in</i>


00:27:34.566 --> 00:27:36.033
<i>He's amazing.</i>


00:27:37.436 --> 00:27:39.097
<i>Not again</i>


00:27:40.038 --> 00:27:42.871
<i>So keep on
Knocking, knocking, knocking</i>


00:27:43.041 --> 00:27:48.240
<i>But, baby, you're better off walking
'Cause I ain't gonna let you in</i>


00:27:48.413 --> 00:27:49.971
<i>Never again</i>


00:27:51.083 --> 00:27:53.677
<i>I went out on a limb again</i>


00:27:53.852 --> 00:27:56.412
<i>I guess I had to lose to win</i>


00:27:56.588 --> 00:28:00.957
<i>I was too confused to know
Which way to turn</i>


00:28:02.361 --> 00:28:05.023
<i>- And she could be a millionaire...
- Crap.</i>


00:28:05.197 --> 00:28:07.461
<i>- Gail needs me to drive her home.
- I don't care</i>


00:28:07.632 --> 00:28:10.294
<i>'Cause, baby, there's nobody home</i>


00:28:10.469 --> 00:28:12.960
<i>Nobody's home at all, yeah</i>


00:28:17.442 --> 00:28:19.569
- What? Did you write that?
- Yeah.


00:28:19.745 --> 00:28:22.373
Reminds me of, um... Uh...


00:28:22.547 --> 00:28:25.880
- Danger Fruit, right? Danger Fruit.
- Ha, ha. Because I wrote their album too.


00:28:26.151 --> 00:28:28.642
Shut up. Took me forever
to find that bootleg online.


00:28:28.820 --> 00:28:30.811
- I love that album. That's crazy.
- Yeah.


00:28:30.989 --> 00:28:33.287
My dad doesn't know.
And he thought the record...


00:28:33.458 --> 00:28:35.153
...was a pile of crap.


00:28:35.427 --> 00:28:37.122
He thinks writing's a waste of time.


00:28:37.562 --> 00:28:41.396
Because he basically wants me
to be like him. Only with better hair.


00:28:41.867 --> 00:28:45.963
But the first thing I thought when
I heard those guys in the urinals was...


00:28:46.138 --> 00:28:47.162
...good acoustics.


00:28:47.572 --> 00:28:51.406
Second thought was these guys,
these guys could be great.


00:28:51.576 --> 00:28:53.168
If you gave them your song.


00:28:54.579 --> 00:28:56.240
Mate, that's a brilliant idea.


00:28:56.982 --> 00:28:59.678
- So put them in the Showcase?
- Put them in the Showcase.


00:28:59.851 --> 00:29:01.182
Yeah.


00:29:02.854 --> 00:29:09.384
<i>You can never tell where this might go</i>


00:29:09.694 --> 00:29:10.991
You wrote that song today?


00:29:11.163 --> 00:29:14.621
- You've been home for what, two hours?
- It's like an answer to his song.


00:29:14.900 --> 00:29:16.197
You really like this guy.


00:29:16.368 --> 00:29:18.063
Yeah, I'm an idiot.


00:29:18.236 --> 00:29:20.431
You have to sing that for him.


00:29:20.605 --> 00:29:24.097
What if you sang to him in secret?


00:29:25.911 --> 00:29:28.709
At the dance. Ta-da.


00:29:32.317 --> 00:29:35.150
Okay, I know the card's
like, really cheesy, but...


00:29:37.189 --> 00:29:39.657
Oh, God, I hope you like it.


00:29:39.991 --> 00:29:43.483
Ange, it's beautiful,
but are you crazy?


00:29:43.662 --> 00:29:45.687
No, I know you're crazy.


00:29:45.864 --> 00:29:46.888
Am not.


00:29:47.933 --> 00:29:50.925
- What if he doesn't even like me?
- You'll both be in disguise.


00:29:51.102 --> 00:29:53.798
It's your chance to see
if he was really flirting with you.


00:29:53.972 --> 00:29:56.532
I was naked. Of course he was flirting.


00:29:56.708 --> 00:29:59.404
And why even torture myself?
It's not like I can have him.


00:29:59.578 --> 00:30:01.512
Why not? Tell him how you feel.


00:30:01.680 --> 00:30:05.707
If he feels the same way, you can reveal
your hot self and he won't tell Gail.


00:30:06.084 --> 00:30:09.178
And if he hates the song,
leave the disguise on.


00:30:12.123 --> 00:30:13.647
Okay.


00:30:13.959 --> 00:30:15.551
I'm going to the dance.


00:30:15.727 --> 00:30:17.058
That's my girl.


00:30:17.329 --> 00:30:21.322
<i>Maurice, no, no.
Again, in Français, longer legs.</i>


00:30:21.500 --> 00:30:24.799
I wouldn't go in your closet
for a little while if I were you.


00:30:24.970 --> 00:30:26.733
What? Why?


00:30:26.905 --> 00:30:28.270
Hey. Wake up.


00:30:32.177 --> 00:30:33.735
Katie!


00:30:33.912 --> 00:30:37.348
The cat has pooped in my closet.
I need you to clean it up.


00:30:37.516 --> 00:30:39.006
Go.


00:30:39.184 --> 00:30:40.913
I told you we don't have a cat.


00:30:41.086 --> 00:30:42.417
Angie, heads up.


00:30:44.389 --> 00:30:45.686
Katie!


00:30:50.896 --> 00:30:52.625
What's going on?


00:30:52.797 --> 00:30:54.230
Nothing.


00:30:54.399 --> 00:30:57.527
I am, uh, re-organizing and labeling. I...


00:30:57.702 --> 00:31:00.000
I took up crochet.
Do you want new socks?


00:31:00.171 --> 00:31:04.232
I would make you a sweater, but I hear
that the arms, that they're really hard.


00:31:07.479 --> 00:31:11.643
Oh, you thought you could sneak off
and go to the dance.


00:31:11.816 --> 00:31:14.046
After what you pulled today with Guy.


00:31:14.219 --> 00:31:15.652
Oh, no, no.


00:31:15.820 --> 00:31:18.311
Oh, no, no, no.


00:31:18.490 --> 00:31:20.788
You're on Victor watch tonight...


00:31:20.959 --> 00:31:23.655
...tomorrow night and every night.


00:31:23.828 --> 00:31:24.852
Fun.


00:31:25.030 --> 00:31:28.158
I'll give Victor all the mothering
you don't have time for.


00:31:28.333 --> 00:31:31.734
Oh, I wish you could be my mommy.


00:31:32.604 --> 00:31:34.629
I'm off to my cinnamon colonic.


00:31:38.610 --> 00:31:40.976
Hey. Get down.
You're gonna break yourself.


00:31:41.313 --> 00:31:43.577
Or worse, the furniture.


00:31:43.882 --> 00:31:46.976
Hello?
- Hey.


00:31:47.252 --> 00:31:50.415
- You look like you're having fun.
- Always.


00:31:50.755 --> 00:31:53.815
Well, I couldn't let you not go to the dance
without me.


00:31:53.992 --> 00:31:56.392
Besides, we have six hours
of shirtless Team Jacob.


00:31:56.561 --> 00:31:59.496
So let's just get this party started.


00:31:59.664 --> 00:32:03.691
- So is Victor driving you nuts?
- I swear to you, he's not human.


00:32:03.969 --> 00:32:07.268
I mean, can you really blame him, though?
Just look at this family.


00:32:08.473 --> 00:32:09.770
Victor, what are you doing?


00:32:19.751 --> 00:32:22.015
Oh, no. Great.


00:32:22.187 --> 00:32:24.382
Eh, she actually looks prettier
that way.


00:32:24.990 --> 00:32:28.016
True. Ugh. Whatever.


00:32:29.194 --> 00:32:32.322
Why did I ever think that tonight
could've been something special.


00:32:33.098 --> 00:32:35.362
Think Bev's all over Luke at the dance
right now?


00:32:35.533 --> 00:32:37.831
They're probably making out. See?


00:32:38.003 --> 00:32:41.200
- Victor, give it a rest.
- Just check it out. Come on.


00:32:44.409 --> 00:32:47.037
<i>Luke is gonna produce
whoever wins the Showcase.</i>


00:32:47.212 --> 00:32:50.272
<i>So we need a little insurance.</i>


00:32:50.448 --> 00:32:53.645
<i>- I know what I'm doing, Mother.
Do you?</i>


00:32:54.552 --> 00:32:57.419
I can't take it anymore, okay?


00:32:57.589 --> 00:32:59.648
I'm taking my life into my own hands.


00:32:59.824 --> 00:33:00.916
I'm talking to Luke.


00:33:01.526 --> 00:33:04.017
- Finally.
- Okay, but we have gotta be home...


00:33:04.195 --> 00:33:05.662
...before Gail gets here.


00:33:06.398 --> 00:33:07.729
What about the demon spawn?


00:33:07.899 --> 00:33:08.923
Mm-hm.


00:33:09.100 --> 00:33:10.499
Right.


00:33:11.503 --> 00:33:12.902
Okay, just watch him.


00:33:15.974 --> 00:33:17.236
Hmm.


00:33:22.047 --> 00:33:24.038
Is that all you've got, Angela?


00:33:24.716 --> 00:33:25.740
Ravi?


00:33:27.419 --> 00:33:29.944
My sister could catch that, jerknut.


00:33:30.121 --> 00:33:32.555
Put some nuts in that sack, ref.


00:33:34.693 --> 00:33:37.253
Miss Katie, I am most startled.


00:33:37.429 --> 00:33:38.623
Obviously.


00:33:39.164 --> 00:33:41.655
All right. All right. Don't hate me.


00:33:41.833 --> 00:33:43.391
Okay, don't hate me. I'm sorry.


00:33:43.568 --> 00:33:46.935
But my name ain't Ravi. It's Tony.


00:33:47.472 --> 00:33:50.600
- Tony.
- Tony Gupta from Jersey.


00:33:50.775 --> 00:33:53.437
- From Jersey.
- I am half Indian.


00:33:53.812 --> 00:33:57.213
My friends call me Meatball
because I'm half Italian.


00:33:57.382 --> 00:33:59.247
Truth is I always wanted to be an actor.


00:33:59.617 --> 00:34:01.141
But I never got my shot.


00:34:01.319 --> 00:34:03.549
I'm working at KFC,
and one day, Gail comes in...


00:34:03.722 --> 00:34:06.122
...she's like, "Are you Indian?"
I'm like, "What?"


00:34:06.291 --> 00:34:08.486
She's like, "Are you a guru?"
I'm like:


00:34:08.660 --> 00:34:10.150
"Who is asking?"


00:34:10.428 --> 00:34:13.795
She says, "Someone
who's paying for some spiritual guidance."


00:34:13.965 --> 00:34:16.559
And I'm like, "Whaa! It's a miracle!"


00:34:16.735 --> 00:34:21.104
I finally get a chance to do
a total immersion into a character.


00:34:21.406 --> 00:34:23.670
Real training and I get paid.
Are you kidding me?


00:34:23.842 --> 00:34:26.242
Ravi is my King Lear.


00:34:26.578 --> 00:34:29.206
<i>You wanna hear
the monologue from My Fair Lady?</i>


00:34:29.380 --> 00:34:30.574
- Oy, mate.
- No, thanks.


00:34:31.783 --> 00:34:34.479
I'm sorry I barged in. Whoops.


00:34:37.288 --> 00:34:40.951
Your secret's safe with me, okay?
But I need to ask you a favor.


00:34:41.626 --> 00:34:43.685
- Meatball.
- Ha, Meatball.


00:34:43.862 --> 00:34:46.330
Please watch Victor tonight
so I can go to the dance?


00:34:46.498 --> 00:34:47.556
Are you kidding me? Done.


00:34:49.134 --> 00:34:50.465
Blow it up.


00:34:52.403 --> 00:34:53.961
Thank you.


00:35:03.782 --> 00:35:05.181
Whoa.


00:35:05.350 --> 00:35:07.978
How am I supposed to find Luke
if everybody's got a mask?


00:35:08.153 --> 00:35:11.213
I never said this was
gonna be easy. Let's do some recon.


00:35:12.590 --> 00:35:14.922
I am Assistant Principal
Dorothy Plumberg.


00:35:15.093 --> 00:35:18.324
No drinking. No texting. No kissing.


00:35:21.032 --> 00:35:24.001
Luke? No. Luke Morgan?


00:35:24.169 --> 00:35:27.798
No leaving the premises
and no experiencing joy of any kind.


00:35:28.506 --> 00:35:30.838
Luke? Ugh.


00:35:36.214 --> 00:35:37.647
Where is he?


00:35:38.483 --> 00:35:41.281
That reminds me.
I got a new act for you to listen to.


00:35:41.452 --> 00:35:43.113
- Now?
- No time like it.


00:35:43.288 --> 00:35:45.722
- Dude, not again...
- We're called Big Pain Ticket.


00:35:49.227 --> 00:35:52.788
<i>I wanna kiss your apocalypse</i>


00:35:52.964 --> 00:35:56.297
<i>Wrap you in my Armageddon</i>


00:35:56.467 --> 00:35:58.662
<i>Sing you a twisted serenade</i>


00:35:58.870 --> 00:36:01.600
They're good, but I'm worried
that chain saw's unsafe.


00:36:01.773 --> 00:36:04.207
Dude, the chain saw's,
like, the best part.


00:36:11.015 --> 00:36:12.073
I think I found him.


00:36:12.250 --> 00:36:14.514
Well, he is blond.


00:36:17.622 --> 00:36:19.920
Oh, my God, what is she doing here?


00:36:21.826 --> 00:36:24.124
I hate teenage desperation.


00:36:24.295 --> 00:36:25.694
What are you doing here?


00:36:25.864 --> 00:36:28.697
Oh, honey, the prize pig
doesn't win the blue ribbon...


00:36:28.867 --> 00:36:30.892
...by covering up its third best asset.


00:36:31.069 --> 00:36:34.004
A, what does that even mean
and, B, did you just call me a pig?


00:36:34.172 --> 00:36:36.003
Honey, I saw you making sweet love...


00:36:36.174 --> 00:36:38.642
...to a plate of Swedish meatballs
at the snack table.


00:36:41.079 --> 00:36:43.206
It's now or never, babe.


00:36:44.749 --> 00:36:48.185
- What if she recognizes me?
- I'll distract her. Go.


00:36:48.353 --> 00:36:50.548
- So was I right or was I right?
- You were right.


00:36:50.722 --> 00:36:53.589
You have very cool taste.
Any more auditions in the men's...


00:36:53.758 --> 00:36:55.692
...and you're fired.


00:36:58.730 --> 00:37:02.257
- I know your secret.
- Which secret is that?


00:37:04.869 --> 00:37:06.359
I heard you sing at school.


00:37:06.604 --> 00:37:07.730
You were amazing.


00:37:07.906 --> 00:37:08.964
Do I know you?


00:37:13.311 --> 00:37:15.905
- I wanna show you something.
- What's your name?


00:37:18.249 --> 00:37:20.308
Angela, what are you doing?


00:37:20.952 --> 00:37:23.443
I'd like to make a request.


00:37:27.959 --> 00:37:30.792
I will make your night. I promise.


00:37:30.962 --> 00:37:32.327
Miss Van R.


00:37:32.964 --> 00:37:35.364
Is it true you wanted to be a dancer
when you were younger...


00:37:35.533 --> 00:37:36.727
...but were never good enough?


00:37:38.102 --> 00:37:39.763
Who told you that?


00:37:57.488 --> 00:37:58.921
Well, now, how lovely.


00:37:59.090 --> 00:38:02.287
But I've seen better dancing
in a Filipino prison, sugar.


00:38:02.460 --> 00:38:03.586
Oh!


00:38:03.761 --> 00:38:07.993
Really? Because I think
I just challenged you to a dance battle.


00:38:12.337 --> 00:38:15.431
Would Luke Morgan please pick up
the white courtesy phone?


00:38:15.606 --> 00:38:18.507
Luke Morgan, white courtesy phone.


00:38:23.281 --> 00:38:26.011
Hold on. What is that?
You've never seen a guitar before?


00:38:26.351 --> 00:38:29.047
You hid a guitar in there.
You hiding anything else?


00:38:29.220 --> 00:38:30.482
Follow me.


00:38:35.526 --> 00:38:37.357
Oh, wow.


00:38:39.831 --> 00:38:45.394
Madam, while your exquisite eyes
tell of a radiant, but mischievous beauty...


00:38:46.270 --> 00:38:48.170
...I have grown impatient.


00:38:48.339 --> 00:38:52.036
Off with your veil,
so that I may know the truth.


00:38:53.544 --> 00:38:54.738
Or not.


00:38:57.015 --> 00:39:00.041
I'm hoping this answers
a lot of your questions.


00:39:06.257 --> 00:39:09.818
<i>I can see it from the spark in your eyes</i>


00:39:11.129 --> 00:39:15.361
<i>You believe in all the things
You've denied</i>


00:39:15.533 --> 00:39:19.060
<i>You wanna fly
And leave your worries behind</i>


00:39:19.237 --> 00:39:23.230
<i>Don't you? Don't you?</i>


00:39:25.209 --> 00:39:28.542
<i>Well, now I'm knocking
At your front door</i>


00:39:30.314 --> 00:39:34.011
<i>And I'm looking for the right cure</i>


00:39:34.685 --> 00:39:38.382
<i>I'm still a little bit unsure</i>


00:39:38.856 --> 00:39:41.689
Okay, now take off that veil.


00:39:42.160 --> 00:39:43.252
Uh-uh.


00:42:22.186 --> 00:42:24.780
I think I've blown something.


00:42:24.956 --> 00:42:28.016
Does anyone else smell cinnamon?


00:42:30.628 --> 00:42:32.186
Move it, fatso.


00:42:33.931 --> 00:42:40.530
<i>You can never tell where this might go</i>


00:42:41.272 --> 00:42:44.901
Okay, you are blowing my mind.
You have to show me who you are.


00:42:57.455 --> 00:42:58.888
- We have to go.
- What?


00:42:59.056 --> 00:43:01.081
- Come.
- No, Ange.


00:43:01.259 --> 00:43:03.819
In the middle of a really big moment
right now.


00:43:03.995 --> 00:43:05.963
Someone had an accident
and went home.


00:43:08.432 --> 00:43:09.797
I'm so sorry.


00:43:10.501 --> 00:43:11.729
What...? You...?


00:43:12.436 --> 00:43:14.097
Hey. Wait.


00:43:14.272 --> 00:43:15.500
But who are you?


00:43:15.673 --> 00:43:18.267
Over here. Go, go, go.


00:43:26.417 --> 00:43:29.443
- We beat her.
- I love you for this.


00:43:47.905 --> 00:43:49.930
Interesting babysitting attire.


00:43:50.708 --> 00:43:53.643
I should've known
you'd go behind my back again.


00:43:54.078 --> 00:43:57.013
And that Paula Abdul wannabe,
trying to distract me.


00:43:57.348 --> 00:43:59.543
Don't talk about her like that.


00:44:01.552 --> 00:44:04.715
Your friend wants to be a choreographer,
if memory serves.


00:44:04.889 --> 00:44:08.450
She might've made a decent one
if she hadn't gotten herself expelled.


00:44:08.626 --> 00:44:10.890
Guess she can kiss
them Juilliard dreams goodbye.


00:44:11.062 --> 00:44:14.122
Look, I'll do whatever you want.
Okay? Just leave Ange out of this.


00:44:14.432 --> 00:44:17.560
That depends if you pull another stunt
like tonight, sugar.


00:44:18.469 --> 00:44:21.597
- I won't.
- I'll be taking this.


00:44:28.112 --> 00:44:31.343
Only her eyes were piercing out
through this veil, but her voice...


00:44:31.515 --> 00:44:33.574
How hot was the girl
on a scale of one to 10?


00:44:33.751 --> 00:44:35.685
- An 11.
- The hotness scale only goes 10.


00:44:35.853 --> 00:44:37.548
Yeah, this girl has love potential.


00:44:37.722 --> 00:44:40.020
- Ooh, love.
- Shut it.


00:44:41.392 --> 00:44:45.522
We are gonna do this for hours
until we get it right. Even if it takes hours.


00:44:46.497 --> 00:44:50.092
Now, sing like your life depends on it.
Because, sugar, it does.


00:44:51.168 --> 00:44:52.795
We're recording.


00:44:53.104 --> 00:44:54.935
<i>Plug in the mike</i>


00:44:55.106 --> 00:44:56.334
<i>Open the curtain</i>


00:44:56.941 --> 00:44:58.875
<i>Turn on the lights</i>


00:44:59.043 --> 00:45:00.772
<i>I'm through rehearsing</i>


00:45:00.945 --> 00:45:03.277
- Dang, she's good, man.
- Told you, man.


00:45:03.447 --> 00:45:04.675
Check this out, all right?


00:45:04.849 --> 00:45:08.444
Thirty-nine girls in the singing program
which means 85 percent...


00:45:08.619 --> 00:45:10.450
...have music during the sixth period.


00:45:10.621 --> 00:45:12.452
So your girl's in one of those rooms.


00:45:12.656 --> 00:45:14.681
<i>The feeling ignites</i>


00:45:14.859 --> 00:45:16.019
<i>I'm in control</i>


00:45:16.193 --> 00:45:18.161
Oh, cut. Cut.


00:45:18.329 --> 00:45:20.194
That was subpar at best.


00:45:20.364 --> 00:45:22.889
From the top, pretty please.


00:45:23.634 --> 00:45:26.933
<i>Amazing grace</i>


00:45:27.104 --> 00:45:28.662
It's cool, I got this.


00:45:28.839 --> 00:45:31.205
Ladies, all my single ladies.


00:45:31.375 --> 00:45:34.401
My boy Luke here has a special favor
to ask of you, all right?


00:45:34.578 --> 00:45:37.672
He needs vocals
for this big show coming up, so...


00:45:37.848 --> 00:45:39.406
- My name is...
- Luke Morgan.


00:45:39.850 --> 00:45:42.717
You will put me in the Showcase.
Oh, yes, you will.


00:45:43.254 --> 00:45:46.815
- Maybe I could ask you to sing first?
- I am so gonna rock your world.


00:45:47.091 --> 00:45:50.424
<i>I love the way you love me, Luke</i>


00:45:50.594 --> 00:45:53.188
<i>Inside my head every night</i>


00:45:53.364 --> 00:45:55.832
<i>You come and kiss me good night</i>


00:45:56.000 --> 00:45:59.094
<i>Whatever you see is what you get</i>


00:45:59.270 --> 00:46:01.795
Why don't you not suck
and do it again, okay?


00:46:03.541 --> 00:46:08.137
<i>I wanna be with you forever...</i>


00:46:08.312 --> 00:46:11.281
What is going on in here? Disgusting.


00:46:11.449 --> 00:46:14.282
You two boys are not in my class.
Stop. Wait.


00:46:20.324 --> 00:46:23.521
Stop. Wait. Stop.


00:46:42.646 --> 00:46:44.944
<i>I got nothing to lose</i>


00:46:45.115 --> 00:46:46.309
<i>I've been exposed</i>


00:46:46.484 --> 00:46:48.782
<i>I'm paying my dues</i>


00:46:48.953 --> 00:46:50.318
<i>Playing the role</i>


00:46:51.155 --> 00:46:53.282
- Oh, really?
- We are back where we started.


00:46:53.457 --> 00:46:54.583
This is not good.


00:46:56.160 --> 00:46:57.957
That's her. That's her voice.


00:46:58.128 --> 00:46:59.959
Don't think you can get away from me.


00:47:00.130 --> 00:47:02.530
- Step aside. Step aside.
- Please. Wait.


00:47:02.700 --> 00:47:06.136
Okay. But first, why don't you
just both audition for me.


00:47:06.303 --> 00:47:07.327
Listen...


00:47:07.505 --> 00:47:10.941
<i>Luke, you are the one for me, yes you are</i>


00:47:11.108 --> 00:47:12.769
<i>You just don't know it yet</i>


00:47:24.622 --> 00:47:28.615
<i>Make you believe in me</i>


00:47:28.792 --> 00:47:31.784
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


00:47:31.962 --> 00:47:35.591
<i>Tonight is the night
Where I make you see</i>


00:47:35.766 --> 00:47:39.702
<i>That I can be
Anything, anything, anything</i>


00:47:39.870 --> 00:47:43.670
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


00:47:44.208 --> 00:47:47.109
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


00:47:47.278 --> 00:47:50.338
<i>Tonight is the night
Where I make you see</i>


00:47:52.149 --> 00:47:54.083
It was you?


00:47:54.752 --> 00:47:57.846
- Oh, sorry to interrupt.
- Oh, no, honey. Interrupt away.


00:47:58.789 --> 00:48:02.623
I didn't think I'd see you. It was killing me.
Because I felt like we connected.


00:48:04.261 --> 00:48:07.287
Excuse me.
Uh, how exactly did you two connect?


00:48:07.464 --> 00:48:10.228
Yeah, how did we? I mean, we did.


00:48:10.401 --> 00:48:12.528
- Through...
- With your lyrics. They just...


00:48:13.170 --> 00:48:15.900
- I can't get them out of my head.
- My lyrics. Yeah.


00:48:16.173 --> 00:48:17.936
Well, how wonderful.


00:48:18.108 --> 00:48:21.475
But, uh, Bev has to prepare
for her Showcase audition.


00:48:21.645 --> 00:48:23.909
Oh, no. She doesn't need to audition.
You're in.


00:48:25.416 --> 00:48:27.213
Do you wanna grab a bite later?


00:48:27.384 --> 00:48:28.476
- Yeah.
Wait.


00:48:29.420 --> 00:48:30.887
You have a date with detention.


00:48:31.055 --> 00:48:32.522
Actually, he has a date with me.


00:48:32.690 --> 00:48:34.419
Dear me, did I not fire you?


00:48:34.592 --> 00:48:37.288
- I have tenure.
- One call and you're wearing a paper hat...


00:48:37.461 --> 00:48:40.589
...that says "Welcome to McDonald's.
How may I take your order?"


00:48:40.764 --> 00:48:42.254
- Five calls.
- Two calls and text.


00:48:42.433 --> 00:48:44.333
Two calls, a text, several long e-mails.


00:48:44.501 --> 00:48:47.299
One text and a Tweet.
- One text and a re-Tweet.


00:48:47.471 --> 00:48:49.837
Oh, for God's sakes,
go lick a chalkboard.


00:48:50.007 --> 00:48:51.474
Fine.


00:48:52.276 --> 00:48:53.800
I hate you.


00:48:57.448 --> 00:49:01.578
Okay. Um, I'd love to write a song with you.
Let's talk about it tonight?


00:49:01.852 --> 00:49:03.786
- I'd love to.
- Okay, you're on.


00:49:10.361 --> 00:49:11.988
I've always wanted to write a song.


00:49:12.162 --> 00:49:15.359
Maybe I'll write about my skin.
They say love tightens your pores.


00:49:15.532 --> 00:49:16.999
What rhymes with pores?


00:49:17.167 --> 00:49:19.965
Chores. Bores. Sores.


00:49:20.137 --> 00:49:22.332
Katie, I've got a new task for you.


