faker than my mom's soul.


01:04:39.974 --> 01:04:43.432
Oh, and don't get the dumb idea
to throw that Showcase.


01:04:43.611 --> 01:04:44.942
Because I talked to a lawyer.


01:04:45.112 --> 01:04:49.811
