01:04:52.720 --> 01:04:55.587
<i>You know, hello, longer legs.</i>


01:04:55.756 --> 01:04:59.419
- Whoa, whoa, whoa. Before you go...
- I'll sing for Bev. Don't worry.


01:04:59.893 --> 01:05:01.918
Well, that was easier than I thought.


01:05:02.096 --> 01:05:03.961
Now, go and make me a vodka tonic.


01:05:04.131 --> 01:05:05.689
Hold the tonic.


01:05:15.409 --> 01:05:17.400
Her reign of terror's gotta stop.


01:05:17.578 --> 01:05:19.102
