01:05:19.280 --> 01:05:21.111
Look, there's nothing you can do.


01:05:21.782 --> 01:05:24.148
If you try to help,
it's just gonna make it worse.


01:05:24.318 --> 01:05:27.344
That woman is a demon
spawned from darkness itself.


01:05:27.521 --> 01:05:28.852
I wish she'd go straight back to...


01:05:29.023 --> 01:05:30.854
Hello, Ms. Gail.


01:05:31.025 --> 01:05:34.426
