01:05:50.511 --> 01:05:53.344
Victor, I thought you hated me.


01:05:53.514 --> 01:05:54.606
Are you an idiot?


01:05:54.782 --> 01:05:56.943
You're the only person
who knows my birthday.


01:05:57.117 --> 01:05:58.982
The only one who says goodnight
to me.


01:05:59.153 --> 01:06:01.553
