mac and cheese.


01:06:01.722 --> 01:06:03.917
You're annoying and ugly...


01:06:04.091 --> 01:06:05.490
...but I sort of love you.


01:06:07.928 --> 01:06:09.555
I sort of love you too.


01:06:10.164 --> 01:06:14.624
But just promise me
you're not gonna do anything, okay?


01:06:15.102 --> 01:06:16.694
- You too.
- Oh, come on.


01:06:16.870 --> 01:06:18.804
- Just... No... Ple...
- Just... No. Just...


01:06:18.972 --> 01:06:20.462
- No. Tony.
- Just one...


01:06:21.375 --> 01:06:22.706
Okay.


01:06:22.976 --> 01:06:27.379
All right.
Well, now I get to go fold Bev's delicates.


01:06:42.896 --> 01:06:46.525
- Have you heard of knocking?
- Ever heard of I don't care?


01:06:46.800 --> 01:06:48.961
Where'd you put my blue blouse?


01:06:49.136 --> 01:06:51.229
Oh, okay.


01:06:51.405 --> 01:06:53.930
Okay, which one of these
do you like better?


01:06:54.842 --> 01:06:58.744
