01:07:09.857 --> 01:07:14.294
I'm nervous about tonight.
Oh, my God, why did I just tell you that?


01:07:16.163 --> 01:07:18.256
I don't know.


01:07:18.599 --> 01:07:20.863
It's like my whole body is freaking out.


01:07:21.034 --> 01:07:22.126
I have hives on my butt.


01:07:22.302 --> 01:07:24.770
