01:08:15.856 --> 01:08:17.380
Wear the blue blouse.


01:08:17.558 --> 01:08:19.526
It makes your eyes pop.


01:08:22.629 --> 01:08:23.857
This better work.


01:08:24.431 --> 01:08:26.661
Because if I go down,
you're go down with me.


01:08:39.646 --> 01:08:43.309
Yeah, yeah, yeah.
What's up, my party people?


01:08:43.484 --> 01:08:46.578
