01:11:47.367 --> 01:11:50.302
Um, here are my boys, the Oral Majority.


01:11:59.012 --> 01:12:01.480
<i>I'm lost in a world that rattles my brain</i>


01:12:01.648 --> 01:12:05.550
<i>Cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:12:08.355 --> 01:12:09.720
Move it. Guy.


01:12:09.890 --> 01:12:14.088
