01:17:16.496 --> 01:17:18.361
The demo you snuck my dad. I heard it.


01:17:18.531 --> 01:17:20.328
Yeah, do it!
Do it!


01:17:20.500 --> 01:17:25.870
<i>We want more!
We want more! We want more!</i>


01:17:28.641 --> 01:17:30.609
Okay, follow my lead, guys.


01:17:38.318 --> 01:17:42.311
<i>There's a little secret
