01:21:23.676 --> 01:21:25.143
Guy!


01:21:26.479 --> 01:21:30.142
I will have my nirvana moment.


01:21:30.383 --> 01:21:34.149
<i>I'll make you believe in me</i>


01:21:35.622 --> 01:21:38.682
<i>I can be what you want me to be</i>


01:21:38.858 --> 01:21:41.452
Oh, come on. Look alive, people.
I'm a star.


01:21:41.628 --> 01:21:43.186
Let's try this again.


01:21:43.396 --> 01:21:45.261
<i>I'll make you believe...</i>


01:21:46.833 --> 01:21:49.563
Oh, no. You want a piece of me?


01:22:15.228 --> 01:22:17.458
Hey. Clear.


01:22:33.146 --> 01:22:35.307
<i>Run this town tonight</i>


01:22:35.481 --> 01:22:37.847
Where's breakfast...? Sorry.


01:23:19.726 --> 01:23:22.320
<i>I'm lost in a world
That rattles my brain</i>


01:23:22.495 --> 01:23:25.362
<i>I'm cleaning up my life
From the mess you made, oh, oh</i>


01:23:30.336 --> 01:23:33.863
- Katie, are you wearing a doormat?
- Welcome.


01:23:40.313 --> 01:23:42.372
Thanks. Now the pants.


01:23:47.553 --> 01:23:51.853
And then it would just take you somewhere
that you never expected you would go.


01:23:56.295 --> 01:23:59.287
<i>You wanna hear
the monologue from My Fair Lady?</i>


01:23:59.465 --> 01:24:01.592
Oy, mate, oy.


01:24:21.087 --> 01:24:22.952
I love my life.


01:24:23.122 --> 01:24:25.317
<i>Call me.
- Hello?</i>


01:24:47.780 --> 01:24:50.977
<i>Yeah. You like it? You like it? Yeah.</i>

